  "title": "Eva Peron",
  "summary": "Born in Los Toldos, Buenos Aires Province, on 7 May 1919, she went to Buenos Aires in 1935 to become an actress and married Juan Peron in 1945. She became prominent in Peronism; in 1947 a law gave women the vote, the Eva Peron Foundation was created in 1948 and built homes, schools and hospitals, and the Peronist Women's Party was founded in 1949. Critics noted the foundation kept no books. She died of cancer in Buenos Aires on 26 July 1952.",
